The Fortran sources under services/specfun/native/ originate from the
netlib specfun collection (S. Zhang and J. Jin, Wichita State
University, 1996; see NETLIB-SPECFUN-README.txt for the upstream
readme and ACM TOMS Algorithm 759) and are redistributed in
accordance with netlib's free-distribution terms.

Everything else (bindings, build definition, packaging, tests) is
generated by nativegate and relicensed here as MIT.
